<title>USA: IBS Financial Corp increases dividend.</title>
<headline>IBS Financial Corp increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBS Financial Corp said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.08 per share after giving effect to the previously announced 15 percent stock dividend to be paid on May 6.</p>
<p>The increased dividend is payable on June 17 to shareholders of record on May 28.</p>
<p>The prior dividend was $0.08 per share.</p>
